    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-4a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4A(5) Certain legislation relating to Australian Capital Territory not to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-4a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where part of an Act or Ordinance is not an enactment, an\ninstrument made under the Act or Ordinance, as the case may be, is\nnot an enactment unless made for the purposes of the other part of\nthe Act or Ordinance, as the case may be.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Where part of an Act or Ordinance is not an enactment, an\ninstrument made under the Act or Ordinance, as the case may be, is\nnot an enactment unless made for the purposes of the other part of\nthe Act or Ordinance, as the case may be.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-4a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-4a-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-4a-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-4a-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c247dee77a909d1ef07796d698f212198a2d71b8d91b0fa80e5a3842fe324736",
      "skos:note": "Instrument made under an Act or Ordinance is not an enactment unless for the purposes of another part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-4a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4A(5) Certain legislation relating to Australian Capital Territory not to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where part of an Act or Ordinance is not an enactment, an\ninstrument made under the Act or Ordinance, as the case may be, is\nnot an enactment unless made for the purposes of the other part of\nthe Act or Ordinance, as the case may be."
    },
    {
