    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-6c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6C Requirement for Commonwealth contracts",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-6c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an agency if a service is, or is to be,\nprovided under a Commonwealth contract in connection with the\nperformance of the functions or the exercise of the powers of the\nagency.\n(2) The agency must take contractual measures to ensure that the\nagency receives a document if:\n(a) the document is created by, or is in the possession of:\n(i) a contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract; or\n(ii) a subcontractor for the Commonwealth contract; and\n(b) the document relates to the performance of the\nCommonwealth contract (and not to the entry into that\ncontract); and\n(c) the agency receives a request for access to the document.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to an agency if a service is, or is to be,\nprovided under a Commonwealth contract in connection with the\nperformance of the functions or the exercise of the powers of the\nagency.\n(2) The agency must take contractual measures to ensure that the\nagency receives a document if:\n(a) the document is created by, or is in the possession of:\n(i) a contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract; or\n(ii) a subcontractor for the Commonwealth contract; and\n(b) the document relates to the performance of the\nCommonwealth contract (and not to the entry into that\ncontract); and\n(c) the agency receives a request for access to the document.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-6c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-6c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "70156b372415f144521a99f9c279b8e52ba7aa4bb349c5e35b4753e5fc68a2c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-6c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6C Requirement for Commonwealth contracts",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an agency if a service is, or is to be,\nprovided under a Commonwealth contract in connection with the\nperformance of the functions or the exercise of the powers of the\nagency.\n(2) The agency must take contractual measures to ensure that the\nagency receives a document if:\n(a) the document is created by, or is in the possession of:\n(i) a contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract; or\n(ii) a subcontractor for the Commonwealth contract; and\n(b) the document relates to the performance of the\nCommonwealth contract (and not to the entry into that\ncontract); and\n(c) the agency receives a request for access to the document."
    },
    {
