      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Agency must take measures",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Contractual measure required",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Document received"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Exemption of certain persons and bodies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The bodies specified in Division 1 of Part I of Schedule 2, and a\nperson holding and performing the duties of an office specified in\nthat Division, are to be deemed not to be prescribed authorities for\nthe purposes of this Act.\n(1A) For the purposes of the definition of agency, a part of the\nDepartment of Defence specified in Division 2 of Part I of\nSchedule 2:\n(a) is taken not to be included in the Department of Defence (or\nin any other Department) for the purposes of this Act; and\n(b) to avoid doubt, is not an agency in its own right for the\npurposes of this Act.\n(2) The persons, bodies and Departments specified in Part II of\nSchedule 2 are exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to\nthe documents referred to in that Schedule in relation to them.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The bodies specified in Division 1 of Part I of Schedule 2, and a\nperson holding and performing the duties of an office specified in\nthat Division, are to be deemed not to be prescribed authorities for\nthe purposes of this Act.\n(1A) For the purposes of the definition of agency, a part of the\nDepartment of Defence specified in Division 2 of Part I of\nSchedule 2:\n(a) is taken not to be included in the Department of Defence (or\nin any other Department) for the purposes of this Act; and\n(b) to avoid doubt, is not an agency in its own right for the\npurposes of this Act.\n(2) The persons, bodies and Departments specified in Part II of\nSchedule 2 are exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to\nthe documents referred to in that Schedule in relation to them.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-7-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-7-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-7-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "50d55b37d6172ffcffdee53a0d7fcd561d7f4961764d9ff6d003c13a8877285e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Exemption of certain persons and bodies",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The bodies specified in Division 1 of Part I of Schedule 2, and a\nperson holding and performing the duties of an office specified in\nthat Division, are to be deemed not to be prescribed authorities for\nthe purposes of this Act.\n(1A) For the purposes of the definition of agency, a part of the\nDepartment of Defence specified in Division 2 of Part I of\nSchedule 2:\n(a) is taken not to be included in the Department of Defence (or\nin any other Department) for the purposes of this Act; and\n(b) to avoid doubt, is not an agency in its own right for the\npurposes of this Act.\n(2) The persons, bodies and Departments specified in Part II of\nSchedule 2 are exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to\nthe documents referred to in that Schedule in relation to them."
    },
