      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The bodies specified in Division 1 of Part I of Schedule 2, and a person holding and performing the duties of an office specified in that Division, are to be deemed not to be prescribed authorities for the purposes of this Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The exemption ends when these entities would otherwise be prescribed authorities."
