          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "df743a1c6f1f270984e9e97267f3e44b619b23905165c43bceeb61ab31653c7c",
      "skos:note": "Agency must ensure accuracy, up-to-dateness and completeness of published information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-8a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8A(2) Information to be published—what is operational information?",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An agency’s operational information does not include information\nthat is available to members of the public otherwise than by being\npublished by (or on behalf of) the agency.\n8B  Information to be published—accuracy etc.\nAn agency must ensure that information published by the agency\nas required or permitted by this Part is accurate, up-to-date and\ncomplete."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
