    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8C Information to be published—restrictions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-8c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "Exempt documents\n(1) An agency is not required under this Part to publish exempt matter.\nPublication prohibited or restricted by other legislation\n(2) If an enactment, or a Norfolk Island law, restricts or prohibits the\npublication of particular information, an agency is not required\nunder this Part to publish the information otherwise than as\npermitted or required by the enactment or law.\nOperation of restrictions\n(3) This section applies despite section 8.\n\n\nInformation publication scheme  Part II\nInformation to be published  Division 2\nSection 8D\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "skos:definition": "Exempt documents\n(1) An agency is not required under this Part to publish exempt matter.\nPublication prohibited or restricted by other legislation\n(2) If an enactment, or a Norfolk Island law, restricts or prohibits the\npublication of particular information, an agency is not required\nunder this Part to publish the information otherwise than as\npermitted or required by the enactment or law.\nOperation of restrictions\n(3) This section applies despite section 8.\n\n\nInformation publication scheme  Part II\nInformation to be published  Division 2\nSection 8D\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
