    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8d-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8D(3) Information to be published—how (and to whom) information is",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-8d-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The agency must publish the information on a website by:\n(a) making the information available for downloading from the\nwebsite; or\n(b) publishing on the website a link to another website, from\nwhich the information can be downloaded; or\n(c) publishing on the website other details of how the\ninformation may be obtained.\nCharges",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The agency must publish the information on a website by:\n(a) making the information available for downloading from the\nwebsite; or\n(b) publishing on the website a link to another website, from\nwhich the information can be downloaded; or\n(c) publishing on the website other details of how the\ninformation may be obtained.\nCharges",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
