      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If there is a charge for accessing the information, the agency must\npublish details of the charge in the same way as the information is\npublished under this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If there is a charge for accessing the information, the agency must\npublish details of the charge in the same way as the information is\npublished under this section.",
