    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8E Information to be published—Information Commissioner to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-8e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "assist agencies\nThe Information Commissioner may provide appropriate assistance\nto an agency in:\n(a) identifying and preparing information which is required or\npermitted to be published under this Part; and\n(b) determining how (and to whom) the information is required\nor permitted to be published under section 8D.\n\n\nInformation publication scheme  Part II\nReview of information publication scheme  Division 3\nSection 8F\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "skos:definition": "assist agencies\nThe Information Commissioner may provide appropriate assistance\nto an agency in:\n(a) identifying and preparing information which is required or\npermitted to be published under this Part; and\n(b) determining how (and to whom) the information is required\nor permitted to be published under section 8D.\n\n\nInformation publication scheme  Part II\nReview of information publication scheme  Division 3\nSection 8F\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8e-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8e-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ae9f513826c1158c2cc053806d9565e4a9f6f8eeda4bca5d0b4272b79030d225",
      "skos:note": "The Information Commissioner must assist agencies in identifying and preparing required information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-8e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8E Information to be published—Information Commissioner to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "assist agencies\nThe Information Commissioner may provide appropriate assistance\nto an agency in:\n(a) identifying and preparing information which is required or\npermitted to be published under this Part; and\n(b) determining how (and to whom) the information is required\nor permitted to be published under section 8D.\n\n\nInformation publication scheme  Part II\nReview of information publication scheme  Division 3\nSection 8F\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-8e-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
