      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A function or power given to an agency under this Part may be\nperformed or exercised, on behalf of the agency, by:\n(a) the principal officer of the agency; or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A function or power given to an agency under this Part may be\nperformed or exercised, on behalf of the agency, by:\n(a) the principal officer of the agency; or",
