    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Right of access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this Act, every person has a legally enforceable right to\nobtain access in accordance with this Act to:\n(a) a document of an agency, other than an exempt document; or\n(b) an official document of a Minister, other than an exempt\ndocument.\n(2) Subject to this Act, a person’s right of access is not affected by:\n(a) any reasons the person gives for seeking access; or\n(b) the agency’s or Minister’s belief as to what are his or her\nreasons for seeking access.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to this Act, every person has a legally enforceable right to\nobtain access in accordance with this Act to:\n(a) a document of an agency, other than an exempt document; or\n(b) an official document of a Minister, other than an exempt\ndocument.\n(2) Subject to this Act, a person’s right of access is not affected by:\n(a) any reasons the person gives for seeking access; or\n(b) the agency’s or Minister’s belief as to what are his or her\nreasons for seeking access.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f5bd59cb5ab14f21e014a6a1842321651f311d1622447508da93944bd2a7609b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 Right of access",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this Act, every person has a legally enforceable right to\nobtain access in accordance with this Act to:\n(a) a document of an agency, other than an exempt document; or\n(b) an official document of a Minister, other than an exempt\ndocument.\n(2) Subject to this Act, a person’s right of access is not affected by:\n(a) any reasons the person gives for seeking access; or\n(b) the agency’s or Minister’s belief as to what are his or her\nreasons for seeking access."
    },
