    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11B(4) Public interest exemptions—factors",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-11b-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The following factors must not be taken into account in deciding\nwhether access to the document would, on balance, be contrary to\nthe public interest:\n(a) access to the document could result in embarrassment to the\nCommonwealth Government, or cause a loss of confidence in\nthe Commonwealth Government;\n(b) access to the document could result in any person\nmisinterpreting or misunderstanding the document;\n(c) the author of the document was (or is) of high seniority in the\nagency to which the request for access to the document was\nmade;\n(d) access to the document could result in confusion or\nunnecessary debate.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The following factors must not be taken into account in deciding\nwhether access to the document would, on balance, be contrary to\nthe public interest:\n(a) access to the document could result in embarrassment to the\nCommonwealth Government, or cause a loss of confidence in\nthe Commonwealth Government;\n(b) access to the document could result in any person\nmisinterpreting or misunderstanding the document;\n(c) the author of the document was (or is) of high seniority in the\nagency to which the request for access to the document was\nmade;\n(d) access to the document could result in confusion or\nunnecessary debate.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11b-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11b-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a39a83b787e2d200e7dd7fe4d7619616437d92537928d31c8579d0aa9bb012c3",
      "skos:note": "Factors that must not be taken into account when deciding access to a document would be contrary to the public interest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-11b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11B(4) Public interest exemptions—factors",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The following factors must not be taken into account in deciding\nwhether access to the document would, on balance, be contrary to\nthe public interest:\n(a) access to the document could result in embarrassment to the\nCommonwealth Government, or cause a loss of confidence in\nthe Commonwealth Government;\n(b) access to the document could result in any person\nmisinterpreting or misunderstanding the document;\n(c) the author of the document was (or is) of high seniority in the\nagency to which the request for access to the document was\nmade;\n(d) access to the document could result in confusion or\nunnecessary debate."
    },
