      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is not entitled to obtain access under this Part to:\n(a) a document, or a copy of a document, which is, under the\nArchives Act 1983, within the open access period within the\nmeaning of that Act unless the document contains personal\ninformation (including personal information about a deceased\nperson); or",
