      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Document transferred to National Archives",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Agency is deemed to have possession"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-13-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13(3) Documents in certain institutions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-13-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite subsections (1) and (2):\n(a) records of a Royal Commission that are in the care (within\nthe meaning of the Archives Act 1983) of the National\nArchives of Australia are, for the purposes of this Act, taken\nto be documents of an agency and to be in the possession of\nthe Department administered by the Minister administering\nthe Royal Commissions Act 1902; and\n(b) records of the Commission of inquiry (within the meaning of\nthe Quarantine Act 1908, as in force immediately before its\nrepeal) that are in the custody of the Australian Archives are,\nfor the purposes of this Act, taken to be documents of an\nagency and to be in the possession of the Agriculture\nDepartment (within the meaning of the Biosecurity Act\n2015); and\n(c) records of a Commission of inquiry (within the meaning of\nthe Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage\nAct 2006) that are in the custody of the Australian Archives\nare, for the purposes of this Act, taken to be documents of an\nagency and to be in the possession of the Department",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Despite subsections (1) and (2):\n(a) records of a Royal Commission that are in the care (within\nthe meaning of the Archives Act 1983) of the National\nArchives of Australia are, for the purposes of this Act, taken\nto be documents of an agency and to be in the possession of\nthe Department administered by the Minister administering\nthe Royal Commissions Act 1902; and\n(b) records of the Commission of inquiry (within the meaning of\nthe Quarantine Act 1908, as in force immediately before its\nrepeal) that are in the custody of the Australian Archives are,\nfor the purposes of this Act, taken to be documents of an\nagency and to be in the possession of the Agriculture\nDepartment (within the meaning of the Biosecurity Act\n2015); and\n(c) records of a Commission of inquiry (within the meaning of\nthe Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage\nAct 2006) that are in the custody of the Australian Archives\nare, for the purposes of this Act, taken to be documents of an\nagency and to be in the possession of the Department",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-13-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-13-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "88028648c083786cd12ec81d1fc4b8e76b64c302493295b657d233946e7b651f",
      "skos:note": "Records of certain commissions are taken to be documents of an agency and in the possession of a department."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-13-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13(3) Documents in certain institutions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite subsections (1) and (2):\n(a) records of a Royal Commission that are in the care (within\nthe meaning of the Archives Act 1983) of the National\nArchives of Australia are, for the purposes of this Act, taken\nto be documents of an agency and to be in the possession of\nthe Department administered by the Minister administering\nthe Royal Commissions Act 1902; and\n(b) records of the Commission of inquiry (within the meaning of\nthe Quarantine Act 1908, as in force immediately before its\nrepeal) that are in the custody of the Australian Archives are,\nfor the purposes of this Act, taken to be documents of an\nagency and to be in the possession of the Agriculture\nDepartment (within the meaning of the Biosecurity Act\n2015); and\n(c) records of a Commission of inquiry (within the meaning of\nthe Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage\nAct 2006) that are in the custody of the Australian Archives\nare, for the purposes of this Act, taken to be documents of an\nagency and to be in the possession of the Department"
    },
    {
