      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The request must be sent to the agency or Minister. The request\nmay be sent in any of the following ways:\n(a) delivery to an officer of the agency, or a member of the staff\nof the Minister, at the address of any central or regional\noffice of the agency or Minister specified in a current\ntelephone directory;\n(b) postage by pre-paid post to an address mentioned in\nparagraph (a);\n(c) sending by electronic communication to an electronic address\nspecified by the agency or Minister.\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 15\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\nAgency required to assist"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-2a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-2a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:NaturalPerson"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: NaturalPerson"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Request must be sent",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The request is required",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The request must be sent"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15(3) Requests for access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where a person:\n(a) wishes to make a request to an agency; or\n(b) has made to an agency a request that does not comply with\nthis section;\nit is the duty of the agency to take reasonable steps to assist the\nperson to make the request in a manner that complies with this\nsection.\nNote:\nAn agency or Minister may refuse to deal with a request if satisfied\nthat a practical refusal reason exists, after undertaking the request\nconsultation process (see section 24).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Where a person:\n(a) wishes to make a request to an agency; or\n(b) has made to an agency a request that does not comply with\nthis section;\nit is the duty of the agency to take reasonable steps to assist the\nperson to make the request in a manner that complies with this\nsection.\nNote:\nAn agency or Minister may refuse to deal with a request if satisfied\nthat a practical refusal reason exists, after undertaking the request\nconsultation process (see section 24).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "16a733c64f054d65d8cefc3d4ebafb15a23a092f26504ca76fea0a2d5b38fc59",
      "skos:note": "Agency must assist person to make compliant request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15(3) Requests for access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where a person:\n(a) wishes to make a request to an agency; or\n(b) has made to an agency a request that does not comply with\nthis section;\nit is the duty of the agency to take reasonable steps to assist the\nperson to make the request in a manner that complies with this\nsection.\nNote:\nAn agency or Minister may refuse to deal with a request if satisfied\nthat a practical refusal reason exists, after undertaking the request\nconsultation process (see section 24)."
    },
