    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15(4) Requests for access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Where a person has directed to an agency a request that should\nhave been directed to another agency or to a Minister, it is the duty\nof the first-mentioned agency to take reasonable steps to assist the\nperson to direct the request to the appropriate agency or Minister.\nTimeframes for dealing with request",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Where a person has directed to an agency a request that should\nhave been directed to another agency or to a Minister, it is the duty\nof the first-mentioned agency to take reasonable steps to assist the\nperson to direct the request to the appropriate agency or Minister.\nTimeframes for dealing with request",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e8b1752792773db71df4b3dfa88ee7ec64b96ebac15a0158d112e998f9caf997",
      "skos:note": "Duty to assist with request redirection"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15(4) Requests for access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Where a person has directed to an agency a request that should\nhave been directed to another agency or to a Minister, it is the duty\nof the first-mentioned agency to take reasonable steps to assist the\nperson to direct the request to the appropriate agency or Minister.\nTimeframes for dealing with request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-4-norm",
