    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15(5) Requests for access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(5) On receiving a request, the agency or Minister must:\n(a) as soon as practicable but in any case not later than 14 days\nafter the day on which the request is received by or on behalf\nof the agency or Minister, take all reasonable steps to enable\nthe applicant to be notified that the request has been received;\nand\n(b) as soon as practicable but in any case not later than the end of\nthe period of 30 days after the day on which the request is\nreceived by or on behalf of the agency or Minister, take all\nreasonable steps to enable the applicant to be notified of a\ndecision on the request (including a decision under section 21\nto defer the provision of access to a document).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) On receiving a request, the agency or Minister must:\n(a) as soon as practicable but in any case not later than 14 days\nafter the day on which the request is received by or on behalf\nof the agency or Minister, take all reasonable steps to enable\nthe applicant to be notified that the request has been received;\nand\n(b) as soon as practicable but in any case not later than the end of\nthe period of 30 days after the day on which the request is\nreceived by or on behalf of the agency or Minister, take all\nreasonable steps to enable the applicant to be notified of a\ndecision on the request (including a decision under section 21\nto defer the provision of access to a document).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-5-logic-epistemic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15-ss-5-logic-ltl-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c8193a195e8376bb5a0b118710347dee13ae6d80100da512394b4e1cb15dc1a9",
      "skos:note": "Agency must notify applicant of request receipt and decision within 30 days.",
      "dc:description": "Notification of request receipt and decision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15(5) Requests for access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(5) On receiving a request, the agency or Minister must:\n(a) as soon as practicable but in any case not later than 14 days\nafter the day on which the request is received by or on behalf\nof the agency or Minister, take all reasonable steps to enable\nthe applicant to be notified that the request has been received;\nand\n(b) as soon as practicable but in any case not later than the end of\nthe period of 30 days after the day on which the request is\nreceived by or on behalf of the agency or Minister, take all\nreasonable steps to enable the applicant to be notified of a\ndecision on the request (including a decision under section 21\nto defer the provision of access to a document)."
    },
