    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15ac",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15AC Decision not made on request within time—deemed refusal",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15ac"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) a request has been made to an agency or Minister; and\n(b) the period (the initial decision period) covered by\nsubsection (2) has ended since the day the request was\nreceived by, or on behalf of, the agency or Minister; and\n(c) notice of a decision on the request has not been received by\nthe applicant.",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) a request has been made to an agency or Minister; and\n(b) the period (the initial decision period) covered by\nsubsection (2) has ended since the day the request was\nreceived by, or on behalf of, the agency or Minister; and\n(c) notice of a decision on the request has not been received by\nthe applicant.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15ac-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15ac-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "51da50406d0fc8f9b584f3642244e10dd4c64626cd59260c19d17f2ad867a442",
      "skos:note": "Agency must make decision on request within time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15ac",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15AC Decision not made on request within time—deemed refusal",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 61,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) a request has been made to an agency or Minister; and\n(b) the period (the initial decision period) covered by\nsubsection (2) has ended since the day the request was\nreceived by, or on behalf of, the agency or Minister; and\n(c) notice of a decision on the request has not been received by\nthe applicant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15ac-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15ac"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15ac-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide a decision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Request made within time period",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Decision not received"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15A Request for access to personnel records",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.63",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this section:\npersonnel records, in relation to an employee or former employee\nof an agency, means those documents containing personal\ninformation about him or her that are, or have been, kept by the\nagency for personnel management purposes.\n(2) Where:\n(a) there are established procedures in an agency (apart from\nthose provided for by this Act) in accordance with which a\nrequest may be made by an employee of the agency for\naccess to his or her personnel records; and\n(b) a person who is or was an employee of the agency wishes to\nobtain access to his or her personnel records;\nthe person must not apply under section 15 for access to such\nrecords unless the person:\n(c) has made a request for access to the records in accordance\nwith the procedures referred to in paragraph (a); and\n(d) either:\n(i) is not satisfied with the outcome of the request; or\n(ii) has not been notified of the outcome within 30 days\nafter the request was made.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this section:\npersonnel records, in relation to an employee or former employee\nof an agency, means those documents containing personal\ninformation about him or her that are, or have been, kept by the\nagency for personnel management purposes.\n(2) Where:\n(a) there are established procedures in an agency (apart from\nthose provided for by this Act) in accordance with which a\nrequest may be made by an employee of the agency for\naccess to his or her personnel records; and\n(b) a person who is or was an employee of the agency wishes to\nobtain access to his or her personnel records;\nthe person must not apply under section 15 for access to such\nrecords unless the person:\n(c) has made a request for access to the records in accordance\nwith the procedures referred to in paragraph (a); and\n(d) either:\n(i) is not satisfied with the outcome of the request; or\n(ii) has not been notified of the outcome within 30 days\nafter the request was made.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "16ea122e50756e9ce27945898db8eeed4a7ac3bc4e933eb61ae78960aabba47c"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-15a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15A Request for access to personnel records",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 63,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this section:\npersonnel records, in relation to an employee or former employee\nof an agency, means those documents containing personal\ninformation about him or her that are, or have been, kept by the\nagency for personnel management purposes.\n(2) Where:\n(a) there are established procedures in an agency (apart from\nthose provided for by this Act) in accordance with which a\nrequest may be made by an employee of the agency for\naccess to his or her personnel records; and\n(b) a person who is or was an employee of the agency wishes to\nobtain access to his or her personnel records;\nthe person must not apply under section 15 for access to such\nrecords unless the person:\n(c) has made a request for access to the records in accordance\nwith the procedures referred to in paragraph (a); and\n(d) either:\n(i) is not satisfied with the outcome of the request; or\n(ii) has not been notified of the outcome within 30 days\nafter the request was made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15a-ss-1",
