      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.63",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this section:\npersonnel records, in relation to an employee or former employee\nof an agency, means those documents containing personal\ninformation about him or her that are, or have been, kept by the\nagency for personnel management purposes.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this section:\npersonnel records, in relation to an employee or former employee\nof an agency, means those documents containing personal\ninformation about him or her that are, or have been, kept by the\nagency for personnel management purposes.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-15a"
