      "cml:integrityHash": "1afcf37ebbe015f60da1b4be5aa37fc34ef50139a245d59a8626cae6df2aac04",
      "skos:note": "Request transfer to corresponding department if connected with specified body or person's functions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-16-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16(2) Transfer of requests",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where a request is made to an agency for access to a document\nthat:\n(a) originated with, or has been received from, a body which, or\nperson who, is specified in Part I of Schedule 2; and\n(b) is more closely connected with the functions of that body or\nperson than with those of the agency to which the request is\nmade;\nthe request shall be transferred:\n(c) to the Department corresponding to the Department of State\nadministered by the Minister who administers the enactment\nby or under which the body or person is established,\ncontinued in existence or appointed; or\n(d) if the request relates to a document that originated with, or\nhas been received from, a part of the Department of Defence\nspecified in Division 2 of Part I of Schedule 2—to that\nDepartment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-2-norm",
