      "cml:premiseText": "(c) to the Department corresponding to the Department of State administered by the Minister who administers the enactment by or under which the body or person is established, continued in existence or appointed;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16(3) Transfer of requests",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-16-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where a request is made to an agency for access to a document\nthat:\n(a) originated in, or has been received from, another agency,\nbeing an agency specified in Part II of Schedule 2 or an\nagency that is a body corporate established by or under an\nAct specified in Part III of Schedule 2; and\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 16A\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(b) is more closely connected with the functions of the other\nagency in relation to documents in respect of which the other\nagency is exempt from the operation of this Act than with the\nfunctions of the agency to which the request is made;\nthe agency to which the request is made shall transfer the request to\nthe other agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Where a request is made to an agency for access to a document\nthat:\n(a) originated in, or has been received from, another agency,\nbeing an agency specified in Part II of Schedule 2 or an\nagency that is a body corporate established by or under an\nAct specified in Part III of Schedule 2; and\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 16A\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(b) is more closely connected with the functions of the other\nagency in relation to documents in respect of which the other\nagency is exempt from the operation of this Act than with the\nfunctions of the agency to which the request is made;\nthe agency to which the request is made shall transfer the request to\nthe other agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3315508f3d24faf28f81a231510423c692c89f1e50c0c19bec219a2922b1f0b3",
      "skos:note": "Agency must transfer request to another agency if it is more closely connected with the other agency's functions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-16-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16(3) Transfer of requests",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where a request is made to an agency for access to a document\nthat:\n(a) originated in, or has been received from, another agency,\nbeing an agency specified in Part II of Schedule 2 or an\nagency that is a body corporate established by or under an\nAct specified in Part III of Schedule 2; and\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 16A\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(b) is more closely connected with the functions of the other\nagency in relation to documents in respect of which the other\nagency is exempt from the operation of this Act than with the\nfunctions of the agency to which the request is made;\nthe agency to which the request is made shall transfer the request to\nthe other agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
