    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16(5) Transfer of requests",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-16-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where a request is transferred to an agency in accordance with this\nsection, the request is to be taken to be a request:\n(a) made to the agency for access to the document that is the\nsubject of the transfer; and\n(b) received by the agency at the time at which it was first\nreceived by an agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Where a request is transferred to an agency in accordance with this\nsection, the request is to be taken to be a request:\n(a) made to the agency for access to the document that is the\nsubject of the transfer; and\n(b) received by the agency at the time at which it was first\nreceived by an agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "87fe961806f3cb1f1c4b0bccb53359b5ea84d7c3d650512be2c4c315ddb4f05e",
      "skos:note": "Request is taken to be a request made to the agency for access to the document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-16-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16(5) Transfer of requests",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where a request is transferred to an agency in accordance with this\nsection, the request is to be taken to be a request:\n(a) made to the agency for access to the document that is the\nsubject of the transfer; and\n(b) received by the agency at the time at which it was first\nreceived by an agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
