      "cml:premiseText": "(c) would, but for this Act, involve an infringement of copyright\n(other than copyright owned by the Commonwealth, an\nagency or a State) subsisting in matter contained in the\ndocument, being matter that does not relate to the affairs of\nan agency or of a Department of State;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-20-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20(4) Forms of access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-20-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
