      "values:originalText": "(4) Section 26 (reasons for decision) does not apply to the decision to\nrefuse access to the whole document unless the applicant requests",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Section 26 (reasons for decision) does not apply to the decision to\nrefuse access to the whole document unless the applicant requests",
