      "cml:integrityHash": "4483cb05688ba7463ef65c74bc74f3bc8170687ce5ea11cb1b49cdea55d08563",
      "skos:note": "Request for document processing must satisfy certain conditions to avoid diversion of resources. Agency or Minister must undertake a request consultation process before refusing access to a document. Authorized persons can make decisions on behalf of the agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-23-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23(1) Decisions to be made by authorised persons",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), a decision in respect of a request made to\nan agency may be made, on behalf of the agency, by the\nresponsible Minister or the principal officer of the agency or,\nsubject to the regulations, by an officer of the agency acting within\nthe scope of authority exercisable by him or her in accordance with\narrangements approved by the responsible Minister or the principal\nofficer of the agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
