      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) making a copy, or an edited copy, of the document;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency or Minister must make a copy or edited copy of the document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23(1) Decisions to be made by authorised persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-23-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an agency or Minister is satisfied, when dealing with a request\nfor a document, that a practical refusal reason exists in relation to\nthe request (see section 24AA), the agency or Minister:\n(a) must undertake a request consultation process (see\nsection 24AB); and\n(b) if, after the request consultation process, the agency or\nMinister is satisfied that the practical refusal reason still\nexists—the agency or Minister may refuse to give access to\nthe document in accordance with the request.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If an agency or Minister is satisfied, when dealing with a request\nfor a document, that a practical refusal reason exists in relation to\nthe request (see section 24AA), the agency or Minister:\n(a) must undertake a request consultation process (see\nsection 24AB); and\n(b) if, after the request consultation process, the agency or\nMinister is satisfied that the practical refusal reason still\nexists—the agency or Minister may refuse to give access to\nthe document in accordance with the request.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-7"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-8"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-9"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-ltl-10"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-diffusion-11"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-cogai-12"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f7e27837a3b934c19c43a6f6e84a8c49a321958979afab53b2869c9b0123b1ea",
      "skos:note": "Request for document processing must satisfy certain conditions to avoid diversion of resources. Agency or Minister must undertake a request consultation process before refusing access to a document. Authorized persons can make decisions on behalf of the agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-23-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23(1) Decisions to be made by authorised persons",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an agency or Minister is satisfied, when dealing with a request\nfor a document, that a practical refusal reason exists in relation to\nthe request (see section 24AA), the agency or Minister:\n(a) must undertake a request consultation process (see\nsection 24AB); and\n(b) if, after the request consultation process, the agency or\nMinister is satisfied that the practical refusal reason still\nexists—the agency or Minister may refuse to give access to\nthe document in accordance with the request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to process documents within reasonable resource limits.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Request for document processing must satisfy certain conditions.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Diversion of resources is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Processing request may overlap with other agency operations.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The work involved in processing the request would substantially and unreasonably divert the resources of the agency from its other operations.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Request processing must not conflict with other agency activities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurrently",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Request for document processing is a recurring activity.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The request does not satisfy the requirement in paragraph 15(2)(b) (identification of documents).",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Request must be processed regularly to meet specified criteria."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Minister's functions may be interfered with by request processing.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The work involved in processing the request would substantially and unreasonably interfere with the performance of the Minister’s functions.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Request processing must not conflict with Minister's duties."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Minister's resources may be diverted by request processing.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The work involved in processing the request would substantially and unreasonably divert the resources of the Minister from its other operations.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Request processing must not conflict with Minister's duties."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
