      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, the agency or Minister may treat\n2 or more requests as a single request if the agency or Minister is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the requests relate to the same document or documents; or\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 24AA\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(b) the requests relate to documents, the subject matter of which\nis substantially the same.\n24AA  When does a practical refusal reason exist?",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this section, the agency or Minister may treat\n2 or more requests as a single request if the agency or Minister is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the requests relate to the same document or documents; or\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 24AA\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(b) the requests relate to documents, the subject matter of which\nis substantially the same.\n24AA  When does a practical refusal reason exist?",
