      "cml:integrityHash": "fdb17c29fcaece9435c14fb32a6a47ab9022fc5f42762660806eb7037fb71865",
      "skos:note": "Authorized persons can make decisions on behalf of specified courts, tribunals, authorities or bodies. Agency or Minister must consider resources for decision-making. Agency or Minister may treat multiple requests as a single request if satisfied that they relate to the same document or documents."
    },
    {
