    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-2-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must consider resources.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3), but without limiting the matters to which\nthe agency or Minister may have regard...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency or Minister must have regard to the resources that would have to be used for..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Resources are used for decision-making within a timeframe.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3), but without limiting the matters to which\nthe agency or Minister may have regard...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The resources are used for decision-making between certain times."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-2-logic-ltl-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Decision-making is within a timeframe.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3), but without limiting the matters to which\nthe agency or Minister may have regard...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The decision-making is within a certain time frame."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-2-logic-deontic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must consider resources for access decisions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) deciding whether to grant, refuse or defer access to a\ndocument to which the request relates, or to grant access to\nan edited copy of such a document, including resources that\nwould have to be used for...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency or Minister must consider resources for access decisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-2-logic-deontic-7",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must make a copy or edited copy of the document.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) making a copy, or an edited copy, of the document;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency or Minister must make a copy or edited copy of the document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23(1) Decisions to be made by authorised persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-23-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of section 24, a practical refusal reason exists in\nrelation to a request for a document if either (or both) of the\nfollowing applies:\n(a) the work involved in processing the request:\n(i) in the case of an agency—would substantially and\nunreasonably divert the resources of the agency from its\nother operations; or\n(ii) in the case of a Minister—would substantially and\nunreasonably interfere with the performance of the\nMinister’s functions;\n(b) the request does not satisfy the requirement in\nparagraph 15(2)(b) (identification of documents).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of section 24, a practical refusal reason exists in\nrelation to a request for a document if either (or both) of the\nfollowing applies:\n(a) the work involved in processing the request:\n(i) in the case of an agency—would substantially and\nunreasonably divert the resources of the agency from its\nother operations; or\n(ii) in the case of a Minister—would substantially and\nunreasonably interfere with the performance of the\nMinister’s functions;\n(b) the request does not satisfy the requirement in\nparagraph 15(2)(b) (identification of documents).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-7"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-deontic-8"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-9"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-ltl-10"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-diffusion-11"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-logic-cogai-12"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b22cf67d6e7c3376210762f76ec3ee26f93f6019dce365e6a2b2283fb3708f8",
      "skos:note": "Request for document processing must satisfy certain conditions to avoid diversion of resources. Agency or Minister must undertake a request consultation process before refusing access to a document. Authorized persons can make decisions on behalf of the agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-23-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23(1) Decisions to be made by authorised persons",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of section 24, a practical refusal reason exists in\nrelation to a request for a document if either (or both) of the\nfollowing applies:\n(a) the work involved in processing the request:\n(i) in the case of an agency—would substantially and\nunreasonably divert the resources of the agency from its\nother operations; or\n(ii) in the case of a Minister—would substantially and\nunreasonably interfere with the performance of the\nMinister’s functions;\n(b) the request does not satisfy the requirement in\nparagraph 15(2)(b) (identification of documents)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-23-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
