      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), reasonable steps includes the\nfollowing:\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 24AB\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(a) giving the applicant a reasonable opportunity to consult with\nthe contact person;\n(b) providing the applicant with any information that would\nassist the applicant to revise the request.\nExtension of consultation period",
