      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide written notice.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24AB(7) What is a request consultation process?",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(7) The request is taken to have been withdrawn under subsection (6)\nat the end of the consultation period if:\n(a) the applicant does not consult the contact person during the\nconsultation period in accordance with the notice; or\n(b) the applicant does not do one of the things mentioned in\nsubsection (6) before the end of the consultation period.\nConsultation period to be disregarded in calculating processing\nperiod",
      "skos:definition": "(7) The request is taken to have been withdrawn under subsection (6)\nat the end of the consultation period if:\n(a) the applicant does not consult the contact person during the\nconsultation period in accordance with the notice; or\n(b) the applicant does not do one of the things mentioned in\nsubsection (6) before the end of the consultation period.\nConsultation period to be disregarded in calculating processing\nperiod",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b61d3f48d1e92c08b86dafd66896fd83094525f55ce2a4d982449f5c42bdb5c6",
      "skos:note": "Failure to consult during the consultation period results in withdrawal of request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24AB(7) What is a request consultation process?",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 72,
      "values:originalText": "(7) The request is taken to have been withdrawn under subsection (6)\nat the end of the consultation period if:\n(a) the applicant does not consult the contact person during the\nconsultation period in accordance with the notice; or\n(b) the applicant does not do one of the things mentioned in\nsubsection (6) before the end of the consultation period.\nConsultation period to be disregarded in calculating processing\nperiod"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
