    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to consult during the consultation period.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The applicant must consult with the contact person during the consultation period.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Failure to do so results in withdrawal of request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consultation period disregarded in calculating processing period.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The consultation period is disregarded in calculating the processing period.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The consultation period overlaps with the processing period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consultation period ends when conditions are met.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The consultation period ends at the end of the specified time period.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Conditions must be met for the consultation period to end."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Diffuses",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Request is withdrawn due to lack of consultation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The request is taken to have been withdrawn under subsection (6) at the end of the consultation period if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The request is withdrawn due to a lack of consultation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recognizes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Request is recognized as withdrawn due to lack of consultation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The request is taken to have been withdrawn under subsection (6) at the end of the consultation period if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The request is recognized as withdrawn due to a lack of consultation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24AB(8) What is a request consultation process?",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(8) The period starting on the day an applicant is given a notice under\nsubsection (2) and ending on the day the applicant does one of the\nthings mentioned in paragraph (6)(b) or (c) is to be disregarded in\nworking out the 30 day period mentioned in paragraph 15(5)(b).\nNote:\nParagraph 15(5)(b) requires that an agency or Minister take all\nreasonable steps to notify an applicant of a decision on the applicant’s\nrequest within 30 days after the request is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The period starting on the day an applicant is given a notice under\nsubsection (2) and ending on the day the applicant does one of the\nthings mentioned in paragraph (6)(b) or (c) is to be disregarded in\nworking out the 30 day period mentioned in paragraph 15(5)(b).\nNote:\nParagraph 15(5)(b) requires that an agency or Minister take all\nreasonable steps to notify an applicant of a decision on the applicant’s\nrequest within 30 days after the request is made.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "08130a261bad667bac3ae9931246bc91cee543a0165e305d9fd2b555494117bf",
      "skos:note": "Agency or Minister must notify applicant of decision within 30 days after request is made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24AB(8) What is a request consultation process?",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 72,
      "values:originalText": "(8) The period starting on the day an applicant is given a notice under\nsubsection (2) and ending on the day the applicant does one of the\nthings mentioned in paragraph (6)(b) or (c) is to be disregarded in\nworking out the 30 day period mentioned in paragraph 15(5)(b).\nNote:\nParagraph 15(5)(b) requires that an agency or Minister take all\nreasonable steps to notify an applicant of a decision on the applicant’s\nrequest within 30 days after the request is made."
    },
