      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Nothing in this Act shall be taken to require an agency or Minister\nto give information as to the existence or non-existence of a\ndocument where information as to the existence or non-existence\nof that document, if included in a document of an agency, would\ncause the last-mentioned document to be:\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 26\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(a) an exempt document by virtue of section 33 or\nsubsection 37(1) or 45A(1); or\n(b) an exempt document to the extent referred to in\nsubsection 45A(2) or (3).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Nothing in this Act shall be taken to require an agency or Minister\nto give information as to the existence or non-existence of a\ndocument where information as to the existence or non-existence\nof that document, if included in a document of an agency, would\ncause the last-mentioned document to be:\n\n\nAccess to documents  Part III\n\nSection 26\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(a) an exempt document by virtue of section 33 or\nsubsection 37(1) or 45A(1); or\n(b) an exempt document to the extent referred to in\nsubsection 45A(2) or (3).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-25"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-25-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-25-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6465c414afaabe07a91d732729ad2aaaf0f177f1cff132a6b0b7d67d6e26f4bf",
      "skos:note": "No agency or Minister must provide information about the existence of a document if disclosure would exempt it."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-25-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
