      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Agency or Minister must provide notice",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-25-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "25(3) Information as to existence of certain documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-25-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a notice is given under subsection (2) of this section:\n(a) section 26 applies as if the decision to give the notice were a\ndecision referred to in that section; and\n(b) the decision is taken, for the purposes of Part VI, to be a\ndecision refusing to grant access to the document in\naccordance with the request referred to in subsection (2) of\nthis section, for the reason that the document would, if it\nexisted, be:\n(i) an exempt document by virtue of section 33 or\nsubsection 37(1) or 45A(1); or\n(ii) an exempt document to the extent referred to in\nsubsection 45A(2) or (3).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If a notice is given under subsection (2) of this section:\n(a) section 26 applies as if the decision to give the notice were a\ndecision referred to in that section; and\n(b) the decision is taken, for the purposes of Part VI, to be a\ndecision refusing to grant access to the document in\naccordance with the request referred to in subsection (2) of\nthis section, for the reason that the document would, if it\nexisted, be:\n(i) an exempt document by virtue of section 33 or\nsubsection 37(1) or 45A(1); or\n(ii) an exempt document to the extent referred to in\nsubsection 45A(2) or (3).",
      "values:partOf": {
