      "cml:premiseText": "State may reasonably wish to contend that access would be contrary to public interest",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Agency or Minister must consider consultation before granting access"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-26a-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
