    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-26a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26A(3) Consultation—documents affecting Commonwealth-State",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-26a-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, after such consultation has taken place, the agency or Minister\ndecides to give the applicant access to the document, the agency or\nMinister must give written notice of the decision to both of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the State;\n(b) the applicant.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, after such consultation has taken place, the agency or Minister\ndecides to give the applicant access to the document, the agency or\nMinister must give written notice of the decision to both of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the State;\n(b) the applicant.",
      "values:partOf": {
