      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31A Access to exempt and conditionally exempt documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-31a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "The following table summarises how this Act applies to exempt\ndocuments and documents that are conditionally exempt:\nHow this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents\nItem\nIf …\nthen …\nbecause of …\na document is an\nexempt document\nunder Division 2\n(exemptions) or under\nparagraph (b) or (c) of\nthe definition of\nexempt document in\nsubsection 4(1)\naccess to the document\nis not required to be\ngiven\nsubsection 11A(4).\na document is a\nconditionally exempt\ndocument under",
      "skos:definition": "The following table summarises how this Act applies to exempt\ndocuments and documents that are conditionally exempt:\nHow this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents\nItem\nIf …\nthen …\nbecause of …\na document is an\nexempt document\nunder Division 2\n(exemptions) or under\nparagraph (b) or (c) of\nthe definition of\nexempt document in\nsubsection 4(1)\naccess to the document\nis not required to be\ngiven\nsubsection 11A(4).\na document is a\nconditionally exempt\ndocument under",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-31a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-31a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f98c47043bb3b212741695f9f4ed7ffc79af92e2f656e5b2c73fd11071aa2ae",
      "skos:note": "Access to exempt and conditionally exempt documents is not required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-31a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31A Access to exempt and conditionally exempt documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "The following table summarises how this Act applies to exempt\ndocuments and documents that are conditionally exempt:\nHow this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents\nItem\nIf …\nthen …\nbecause of …\na document is an\nexempt document\nunder Division 2\n(exemptions) or under\nparagraph (b) or (c) of\nthe definition of\nexempt document in\nsubsection 4(1)\naccess to the document\nis not required to be\ngiven\nsubsection 11A(4).\na document is a\nconditionally exempt\ndocument under"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-31a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
