    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-42",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Documents subject to legal professional privilege",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A document is an exempt document if it is of such a nature that it\nwould be privileged from production in legal proceedings on the\nground of legal professional privilege.\n(2) A document is not an exempt document because of subsection (1)\nif the person entitled to claim legal professional privilege in\nrelation to the production of the document in legal proceedings\nwaives that claim.\n(3) A document is not an exempt document under subsection (1) by\nreason only that:\n(a) the document contains information that would (apart from\nthis subsection) cause the document to be exempt under\nsubsection (1); and\n(b) the information is operational information of an agency.\nNote:\nFor operational information, see section 8A.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A document is an exempt document if it is of such a nature that it\nwould be privileged from production in legal proceedings on the\nground of legal professional privilege.\n(2) A document is not an exempt document because of subsection (1)\nif the person entitled to claim legal professional privilege in\nrelation to the production of the document in legal proceedings\nwaives that claim.\n(3) A document is not an exempt document under subsection (1) by\nreason only that:\n(a) the document contains information that would (apart from\nthis subsection) cause the document to be exempt under\nsubsection (1); and\n(b) the information is operational information of an agency.\nNote:\nFor operational information, see section 8A.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-42-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-42-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-42-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "51ef546d97c455db9411f697e637eb0fec2aa2534c18c87bd61f4ba0db26aafe"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-42",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42 Documents subject to legal professional privilege",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 95,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A document is an exempt document if it is of such a nature that it\nwould be privileged from production in legal proceedings on the\nground of legal professional privilege.\n(2) A document is not an exempt document because of subsection (1)\nif the person entitled to claim legal professional privilege in\nrelation to the production of the document in legal proceedings\nwaives that claim.\n(3) A document is not an exempt document under subsection (1) by\nreason only that:\n(a) the document contains information that would (apart from\nthis subsection) cause the document to be exempt under\nsubsection (1); and\n(b) the information is operational information of an agency.\nNote:\nFor operational information, see section 8A."
    },
