    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45A(7) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-45a-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(7) Information in a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3)\napplies is not exempt matter because of this section if the\ninformation consists of purely factual material, unless:\n(a) the disclosure of the information would reveal the existence\nof a confidential request; and\n(b) the existence of the confidential request has not been\ndisclosed by the Senator or Member of the House of\nRepresentatives who made the request.\nDefinition",
      "skos:definition": "(7) Information in a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3)\napplies is not exempt matter because of this section if the\ninformation consists of purely factual material, unless:\n(a) the disclosure of the information would reveal the existence\nof a confidential request; and\n(b) the existence of the confidential request has not been\ndisclosed by the Senator or Member of the House of\nRepresentatives who made the request.\nDefinition",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5c68fbb428e0736a0aa69c544cc03432148acddf6eaaa60b1ba6c51abe5bb8a0",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of factual information is not exempt if it reveals a confidential request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-45a-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45A(7) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(7) Information in a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3)\napplies is not exempt matter because of this section if the\ninformation consists of purely factual material, unless:\n(a) the disclosure of the information would reveal the existence\nof a confidential request; and\n(b) the existence of the confidential request has not been\ndisclosed by the Senator or Member of the House of\nRepresentatives who made the request.\nDefinition"
    },
    {
