      "cml:premiseText": "(7) Information in a document...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Disclosure of factual information is not exempt."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45A(8) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-45a-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nconfidential request means a request referred to in\nparagraph 64E(1)(a) or (c) of the Parliamentary Service Act 1999\nthat includes a direction under paragraph 64H(3)(d) or section 64M\n(as the case may be) of that Act to treat the request or any other\ninformation relating to the request as confidential.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) In this section:\nconfidential request means a request referred to in\nparagraph 64E(1)(a) or (c) of the Parliamentary Service Act 1999\nthat includes a direction under paragraph 64H(3)(d) or section 64M\n(as the case may be) of that Act to treat the request or any other\ninformation relating to the request as confidential.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-45a-ss-8-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2e07b82698cbea3be7bdc49bcc745111755cdf419c05ec69597657568070985d",
      "skos:note": "Definition of confidential request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-45a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45A(8) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nconfidential request means a request referred to in\nparagraph 64E(1)(a) or (c) of the Parliamentary Service Act 1999\nthat includes a direction under paragraph 64H(3)(d) or section 64M\n(as the case may be) of that Act to treat the request or any other\ninformation relating to the request as confidential."
    },
