      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this section:\nElectoral Act means the Commonwealth Electoral Act 1918.\nelectoral roll means:\n(a) a Roll of the electors of:\n(i) a State or Territory; or\n(ii) a Division (within the meaning of the Electoral Act); or\n(iii) a Subdivision (within the meaning of the Electoral Act);\nprepared under the Electoral Act; or\n(b) any part of a Roll referred to in paragraph (a)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
