      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) In this section:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "47A(2) Electoral rolls and related documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to this section, a document is an exempt document if it is:\n(a) an electoral roll; or\n(b) a print, or a copy of a print, of an electoral roll; or\n(c) a microfiche of an electoral roll; or\n(d) a copy on tape or disk of an electoral roll; or\n(e) a document that:\n(i) sets out particulars of only one elector; and\n(ii) was used to prepare an electoral roll; or\n(f) a document that:\n(i) is a copy of a document referred to in paragraph (e); or\n(ii) contains only copies of documents referred to in\nparagraph (e); or\n(g) a document (including a habitation index within the meaning\nof the Electoral Act) that:\n(i) sets out particulars of electors; and\n(ii) was derived from an electoral roll.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subject to this section, a document is an exempt document if it is:\n(a) an electoral roll; or\n(b) a print, or a copy of a print, of an electoral roll; or\n(c) a microfiche of an electoral roll; or\n(d) a copy on tape or disk of an electoral roll; or\n(e) a document that:\n(i) sets out particulars of only one elector; and\n(ii) was used to prepare an electoral roll; or\n(f) a document that:\n(i) is a copy of a document referred to in paragraph (e); or\n(ii) contains only copies of documents referred to in\nparagraph (e); or\n(g) a document (including a habitation index within the meaning\nof the Electoral Act) that:\n(i) sets out particulars of electors; and\n(ii) was derived from an electoral roll.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "47d3af6ad5b8b53b6330d5dc8c8c1122825db6cc5512e0511c72fb4c02e65f4d",
      "skos:note": "Defines what constitutes an exempt document under this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47A(2) Electoral rolls and related documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to this section, a document is an exempt document if it is:\n(a) an electoral roll; or\n(b) a print, or a copy of a print, of an electoral roll; or\n(c) a microfiche of an electoral roll; or\n(d) a copy on tape or disk of an electoral roll; or\n(e) a document that:\n(i) sets out particulars of only one elector; and\n(ii) was used to prepare an electoral roll; or\n(f) a document that:\n(i) is a copy of a document referred to in paragraph (e); or\n(ii) contains only copies of documents referred to in\nparagraph (e); or\n(g) a document (including a habitation index within the meaning\nof the Electoral Act) that:\n(i) sets out particulars of electors; and\n(ii) was derived from an electoral roll."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47a-ss-2-norm",
