    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47j-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "47J(3) Public interest conditional exemptions—the economy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-47j-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The documents to which subsection (1) applies include, but are not\nlimited to, documents containing matter relating to any of the\nfollowing:\n(a) currency or exchange rates;\n(b) interest rates;\n(c) taxes, including duties of customs or of excise;\n(d) the regulation or supervision of banking, insurance and other\nfinancial institutions;\n(e) proposals for expenditure;\n(f) foreign investment in Australia;\n(g) borrowings by the Commonwealth, a State or an authority of\nthe Commonwealth, of Norfolk Island or of a State.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The documents to which subsection (1) applies include, but are not\nlimited to, documents containing matter relating to any of the\nfollowing:\n(a) currency or exchange rates;\n(b) interest rates;\n(c) taxes, including duties of customs or of excise;\n(d) the regulation or supervision of banking, insurance and other\nfinancial institutions;\n(e) proposals for expenditure;\n(f) foreign investment in Australia;\n(g) borrowings by the Commonwealth, a State or an authority of\nthe Commonwealth, of Norfolk Island or of a State.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47j-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0d2ff640c2b5db7ad8331780812cc3dae7e6822146d792324a57e2cec57ef56f",
      "skos:note": "List of documents subject to conditional exemptions for the economy"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-47j-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47J(3) Public interest conditional exemptions—the economy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The documents to which subsection (1) applies include, but are not\nlimited to, documents containing matter relating to any of the\nfollowing:\n(a) currency or exchange rates;\n(b) interest rates;\n(c) taxes, including duties of customs or of excise;\n(d) the regulation or supervision of banking, insurance and other\nfinancial institutions;\n(e) proposals for expenditure;\n(f) foreign investment in Australia;\n(g) borrowings by the Commonwealth, a State or an authority of\nthe Commonwealth, of Norfolk Island or of a State."
    },
