        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3701ec1c5e74e360d131c8d5d88d9734348d262f3242429fae30de26146006ba",
      "skos:note": "Ensure amendment of records does not obliterate prior text."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-50-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "50(3) Amendment of records",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 110,
      "values:originalText": "(3) To the extent that it is practicable to do so, the agency or Minister\nmust, when making an amendment under paragraph (2)(a), ensure\nthat the record of information is amended in a way that does not\n\n\nAmendment and annotation of personal records  Part V\n\nSection 51\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\nobliterate the text of the record as it existed prior to the\namendment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-50-ss-3-norm",
