    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-53c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53C Internal review—who is an affected third party?",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-53c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.121",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table has effect:\nWho is an affected third party?\nItem\nIf, in relation to a request for access to a\ndocument ...\nthe affected third\nparty for the\ndocument is ...\nconsultation with a State under section 26A\n(documents affecting Commonwealth-State relations\netc.) is required\nthe State.\nsection 27 (business documents) applies in relation\nto business information in the document\nthe person or\norganisation\nconcerned (within the\nmeaning of\nsection 27).\nsection 27A (documents affecting personal privacy)\napplies in relation to personal information in the\ndocument about a living person\nthe person.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The following table has effect:\nWho is an affected third party?\nItem\nIf, in relation to a request for access to a\ndocument ...\nthe affected third\nparty for the\ndocument is ...\nconsultation with a State under section 26A\n(documents affecting Commonwealth-State relations\netc.) is required\nthe State.\nsection 27 (business documents) applies in relation\nto business information in the document\nthe person or\norganisation\nconcerned (within the\nmeaning of\nsection 27).\nsection 27A (documents affecting personal privacy)\napplies in relation to personal information in the\ndocument about a living person\nthe person.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-53c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6554729ba5b005a8b5328071d24246a8a8f19aef7f4f3dc1871a794d35737eef",
      "skos:note": "Defines who is an affected third party for a document request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-53c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53C Internal review—who is an affected third party?",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 121,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table has effect:\nWho is an affected third party?\nItem\nIf, in relation to a request for access to a\ndocument ...\nthe affected third\nparty for the\ndocument is ...\nconsultation with a State under section 26A\n(documents affecting Commonwealth-State relations\netc.) is required\nthe State.\nsection 27 (business documents) applies in relation\nto business information in the document\nthe person or\norganisation\nconcerned (within the\nmeaning of\nsection 27).\nsection 27A (documents affecting personal privacy)\napplies in relation to personal information in the\ndocument about a living person\nthe person."
    },
