    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54 Internal review—access refusal decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if an access refusal decision is made in relation\nto a request to an agency for access to a document, other than a\ndecision made personally by the principal officer of the agency or\nthe responsible Minister.\n(2) The applicant in relation to the request may apply under this\nPart for the review (the internal review) of the access refusal\ndecision.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if an access refusal decision is made in relation\nto a request to an agency for access to a document, other than a\ndecision made personally by the principal officer of the agency or\nthe responsible Minister.\n(2) The applicant in relation to the request may apply under this\nPart for the review (the internal review) of the access refusal\ndecision.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "309b4e81db92a5f3e82af30b6c27a15e9d43ebefb3ae0c4030f2d119d925f8f9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54 Internal review—access refusal decision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if an access refusal decision is made in relation\nto a request to an agency for access to a document, other than a\ndecision made personally by the principal officer of the agency or\nthe responsible Minister.\n(2) The applicant in relation to the request may apply under this\nPart for the review (the internal review) of the access refusal\ndecision."
    },
