      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The affected third party for the document may apply under this\nPart for the review (the internal review) of the access grant\ndecision.\nNote:\nFor affected third party, see section 53C."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
