          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "baf94cdbfdc2f0707c97f13050839bffc0e65b30d614a2ed2350ed9717cce28e",
      "skos:note": "Internal review deemed affirmation of original decision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54d-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54D(1) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 124,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n(a) an application for internal review has been made to an\nagency; and\n(b) the period (the initial decision period) of 30 days (as\nmentioned in subsection 54C(3)) has ended since the day the\napplication for internal review was received by the agency;\nand\n(c) notice of a decision on the application has not been received\nby the internal review applicant."
    },
    {
