      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Information Commissioner may allow further time considered\nappropriate by the Information Commissioner for the agency to\ndeal with the application.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Information Commissioner may allow further time considered\nappropriate by the Information Commissioner for the agency to\ndeal with the application.",
