        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) makes a decision on the application within the further time allowed; and (b) complies with any condition imposed under subsection (5)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54D(7) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed affirmation) applies as if the\ninitial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the\nInformation Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency:\n(a) does not make a decision on the request within the further\ntime allowed; or\n(b) does not comply with any condition imposed under\nsubsection (5).\nNo further time allowed",
      "skos:definition": "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed affirmation) applies as if the\ninitial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the\nInformation Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency:\n(a) does not make a decision on the request within the further\ntime allowed; or\n(b) does not comply with any condition imposed under\nsubsection (5).\nNo further time allowed",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "faaa88c9d8c01887c004f79d5e8e0e0bd59ac07da696ba18d79a285f3999b525",
      "skos:note": "No further time allowed after agency fails to comply with conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54D(7) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 124,
      "values:originalText": "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed affirmation) applies as if the\ninitial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the\nInformation Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency:\n(a) does not make a decision on the request within the further\ntime allowed; or\n(b) does not comply with any condition imposed under\nsubsection (5).\nNo further time allowed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Agency's failure to comply is prohibited.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "No further time allowed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54D(8) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "(8) If subsection (7) (deemed affirmation after allowance of further\ntime) applies, the Information Commissioner does not have the\npower to allow further time under this section in relation to the\ndecision taken to be made under subsection (2) in its operation as\naffected by subsection (7).",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If subsection (7) (deemed affirmation after allowance of further\ntime) applies, the Information Commissioner does not have the\npower to allow further time under this section in relation to the\ndecision taken to be made under subsection (2) in its operation as\naffected by subsection (7).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "064990332b004336c0129abb12639900247f70540dac9cc4791359f0e409d3ed",
      "skos:note": "Prevents Information Commissioner from allowing further time under this section in relation to a decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54D(8) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 124,
      "values:originalText": "(8) If subsection (7) (deemed affirmation after allowance of further\ntime) applies, the Information Commissioner does not have the\npower to allow further time under this section in relation to the\ndecision taken to be made under subsection (2) in its operation as\naffected by subsection (7)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-8-logic-deontic-1",
