    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54n-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54N(4) IC review applications—application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54n-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.131",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The IC review application must be sent to the Information\nCommissioner. The IC review application may be sent in any of\nthe following ways:\n(a) delivery to the Information Commissioner at the address of\nthe Information Commissioner specified in a current\ntelephone directory;\n(b) postage by pre-paid post to an address mentioned in\nparagraph (a);",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The IC review application must be sent to the Information\nCommissioner. The IC review application may be sent in any of\nthe following ways:\n(a) delivery to the Information Commissioner at the address of\nthe Information Commissioner specified in a current\ntelephone directory;\n(b) postage by pre-paid post to an address mentioned in\nparagraph (a);",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54n"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54n-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54n-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ad5872c0bfc95108e2ea40a2125eb113913b124b861f0caadd9f11b66127dec9",
      "skos:note": "Must send IC review application to Information Commissioner"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54n-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54N(4) IC review applications—application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 131,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The IC review application must be sent to the Information\nCommissioner. The IC review application may be sent in any of\nthe following ways:\n(a) delivery to the Information Commissioner at the address of\nthe Information Commissioner specified in a current\ntelephone directory;\n(b) postage by pre-paid post to an address mentioned in\nparagraph (a);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54n-ss-4-norm",
