      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.133",
      "values:originalText": "Access refusal decisions\n(1) An IC review application in relation to a decision covered by\nsubsection 54L(2) (access refusal decisions) must be made within",
      "skos:definition": "Access refusal decisions\n(1) An IC review application in relation to a decision covered by\nsubsection 54L(2) (access refusal decisions) must be made within",
