    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54t-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54T(6) IC review applications—extension of time",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54t-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.134",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If notice is given under subsection (5), the Information\nCommissioner must give the IC review applicant and the person to\nwhom notice has been given under subsection (4) a reasonable\nopportunity to present their cases before determining the\napplication under subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If notice is given under subsection (5), the Information\nCommissioner must give the IC review applicant and the person to\nwhom notice has been given under subsection (4) a reasonable\nopportunity to present their cases before determining the\napplication under subsection (1).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54t"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54t-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54t-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54t-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f7fd74409a1f0b72e297dd568df9cbee5e60032080267ba818673a218d458022",
      "skos:note": "Must give IC review applicant and person to whom notice has been given a reasonable opportunity to present their cases before determining the application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-54t-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54T(6) IC review applications—extension of time",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If notice is given under subsection (5), the Information\nCommissioner must give the IC review applicant and the person to\nwhom notice has been given under subsection (4) a reasonable\nopportunity to present their cases before determining the\napplication under subsection (1)."
    },
    {
