      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.142",
      "values:originalText": "At the hearing of a proceeding before the Information\nCommissioner, a review party may:\n(a) appear in person; or\n(b) be represented by another person.",
      "skos:definition": "At the hearing of a proceeding before the Information\nCommissioner, a review party may:\n(a) appear in person; or\n(b) be represented by another person.",
