    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55da",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55DA Decision-maker must assist Information Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55da"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.142",
      "values:originalText": "In an IC review, the agency or Minister who made the IC\nreviewable decision must use the agency’s or the Minister’s best\nendeavours to assist the Information Commissioner to make his or\nher decision in relation to the IC review.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nProcedure in IC review  Division 6\nSection 55E\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "skos:definition": "In an IC review, the agency or Minister who made the IC\nreviewable decision must use the agency’s or the Minister’s best\nendeavours to assist the Information Commissioner to make his or\nher decision in relation to the IC review.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nProcedure in IC review  Division 6\nSection 55E\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55da-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55da-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "037270f431efb46dad920bba96cf93470e05f48c2950cd2e8a7fe9a05ddfbfe4",
      "skos:note": "Agency or Minister must assist Information Commissioner in IC review."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55da",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55DA Decision-maker must assist Information Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 142,
      "values:originalText": "In an IC review, the agency or Minister who made the IC\nreviewable decision must use the agency’s or the Minister’s best\nendeavours to assist the Information Commissioner to make his or\nher decision in relation to the IC review.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nProcedure in IC review  Division 6\nSection 55E\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55da-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55da"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55da-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Mandatory duty",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55E Procedure in IC review—inadequate reasons from decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.143",
      "values:originalText": "maker\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) an IC review application is made in relation to an IC\nreviewable decision made by an agency or a Minister; and\n(b) the agency or Minister was required to provide a statement of\nreasons under section 26 for the decision to the person who\nmade the request; and\n(c) the Information Commissioner believes that:\n(i) no statement has been provided; or\n(ii) the statement that has been provided is inadequate.\n(2) The Information Commissioner may, by notice in writing, require\nthe agency or Minister to provide an adequate statement of reasons\nas mentioned in subsection 26(1).\n(3) If the Information Commissioner gives notice under subsection (2),\nthe agency or Minister must provide the adequate statement of\nreasons to the IC review applicant and the Information\nCommissioner within:\n(a) the period specified in the notice; or\n(b) if no period is specified in the notice—28 days after the day\nthe notice was given to the agency or Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "maker\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) an IC review application is made in relation to an IC\nreviewable decision made by an agency or a Minister; and\n(b) the agency or Minister was required to provide a statement of\nreasons under section 26 for the decision to the person who\nmade the request; and\n(c) the Information Commissioner believes that:\n(i) no statement has been provided; or\n(ii) the statement that has been provided is inadequate.\n(2) The Information Commissioner may, by notice in writing, require\nthe agency or Minister to provide an adequate statement of reasons\nas mentioned in subsection 26(1).\n(3) If the Information Commissioner gives notice under subsection (2),\nthe agency or Minister must provide the adequate statement of\nreasons to the IC review applicant and the Information\nCommissioner within:\n(a) the period specified in the notice; or\n(b) if no period is specified in the notice—28 days after the day\nthe notice was given to the agency or Minister.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55e-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55e-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55e-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "878c240fd717f39d8cec9f7a5cf936873ffcc0757beef703ad2c5f9ed1890344"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55E Procedure in IC review—inadequate reasons from decision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 143,
      "values:originalText": "maker\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) an IC review application is made in relation to an IC\nreviewable decision made by an agency or a Minister; and\n(b) the agency or Minister was required to provide a statement of\nreasons under section 26 for the decision to the person who\nmade the request; and\n(c) the Information Commissioner believes that:\n(i) no statement has been provided; or\n(ii) the statement that has been provided is inadequate.\n(2) The Information Commissioner may, by notice in writing, require\nthe agency or Minister to provide an adequate statement of reasons\nas mentioned in subsection 26(1).\n(3) If the Information Commissioner gives notice under subsection (2),\nthe agency or Minister must provide the adequate statement of\nreasons to the IC review applicant and the Information\nCommissioner within:\n(a) the period specified in the notice; or\n(b) if no period is specified in the notice—28 days after the day\nthe notice was given to the agency or Minister."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55e-ss-1",
