      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if, at any stage of an IC review:\n(a) the review parties reach agreement as to the terms of a\ndecision on an IC review:\n(i) on the IC review application; or\n(ii) in relation to a part of the IC review application; or\n(iii) in relation to a matter arising out of the IC review\napplication; and\n(b) the agreement is acceptable to all of the review parties; and",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if, at any stage of an IC review:\n(a) the review parties reach agreement as to the terms of a\ndecision on an IC review:\n(i) on the IC review application; or\n(ii) in relation to a part of the IC review application; or\n(iii) in relation to a matter arising out of the IC review\napplication; and\n(b) the agreement is acceptable to all of the review parties; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55f-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55f-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ecb6d1584fcc10bfc04c24a97013e5535182e2b0423cf12e2e1ea240820c0a79",
      "skos:note": "Review parties must agree on terms of a decision in IC review"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55f",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55F Procedure in IC review—review parties reach agreement",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 143,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if, at any stage of an IC review:\n(a) the review parties reach agreement as to the terms of a\ndecision on an IC review:\n(i) on the IC review application; or\n(ii) in relation to a part of the IC review application; or\n(iii) in relation to a matter arising out of the IC review\napplication; and\n(b) the agreement is acceptable to all of the review parties; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55f-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
