      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.147",
      "values:originalText": "(5) However, a decision on an IC review must not include:\n(a) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1); or\n(b) exempt matter.\nNote:\nSubsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or\notherwise of certain documents.\nProviding copy of decision",
      "skos:definition": "(5) However, a decision on an IC review must not include:\n(a) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1); or\n(b) exempt matter.\nNote:\nSubsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or\notherwise of certain documents.\nProviding copy of decision",
      "values:partOf": {
