      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.149",
      "values:originalText": "A principal officer of an agency or a Minister must comply with a\ndecision of the Information Commissioner under section 55K on an\nIC review.",
      "skos:definition": "A principal officer of an agency or a Minister must comply with a\ndecision of the Information Commissioner under section 55K on an\nIC review.",
