      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.149",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An application under subsection (1) may only be made if:\n(a) the time has ended for making an application to the Tribunal\nunder section 57A for review of the Information\nCommissioner’s decision; and\n(b) such an application is not made before the end of the time.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An application under subsection (1) may only be made if:\n(a) the time has ended for making an application to the Tribunal\nunder section 57A for review of the Information\nCommissioner’s decision; and\n(b) such an application is not made before the end of the time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55p"
      },
