      "values:originalText": "(2) The Information Commissioner may correct an obvious error:\n(a) on an application by a review party; or\n(b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nInformation gathering powers  Division 8\nSection 55R\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Information Commissioner may correct an obvious error:\n(a) on an application by a review party; or\n(b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nInformation gathering powers  Division 8\nSection 55R\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
