      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 153,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the document is produced to the Information Commissioner\n(whether under this section or voluntarily), only the following\npersons may have access to the document, or to the contents of the\ndocument:\n(a) the Information Commissioner;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55t-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
