      "skos:note": "Failure to comply with a notice requirement is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55w-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55W(3) Information gathering powers—obliging persons to appear",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 155,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement specified in a notice\nunder subsection (1); and\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n(c) the person’s conduct breaches the requirement."
    },
