    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55y",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55Y Information gathering powers—no loss of legal professional",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55y"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.156",
      "values:originalText": "privilege\nInformation or a document does not cease to be the subject of legal\nprofessional privilege merely because it is given, provided,\nproduced or referred to for the purposes of this Part.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nInformation gathering powers  Division 8\nSection 55Z\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "skos:definition": "privilege\nInformation or a document does not cease to be the subject of legal\nprofessional privilege merely because it is given, provided,\nproduced or referred to for the purposes of this Part.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nInformation gathering powers  Division 8\nSection 55Z\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55y-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "20d08beb303aa40ad4fa207eca5e1ad5e42e7c62ae6d9d44e9f8b9de3b8fb7ad",
      "skos:note": "No loss of legal professional privilege when information is given, produced or referred to for the purposes of this Part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55y",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55Y Information gathering powers—no loss of legal professional",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 156,
      "values:originalText": "privilege\nInformation or a document does not cease to be the subject of legal\nprofessional privilege merely because it is given, provided,\nproduced or referred to for the purposes of this Part.\n\n\nReview by Information Commissioner  Part VII\nInformation gathering powers  Division 8\nSection 55Z\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55y-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55y"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:LegalPerson"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: LegalPerson"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55z",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55Z Information gathering powers—protection from liability",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55z"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a person does any of the following in good\nfaith for the purposes of an IC review:\n(a) gives information;\n(b) produces a document;\n(c) answers a question.\n(2) If this section applies, then:\n(a) civil proceedings do not lie against a person because the\nperson does any of the matters mentioned in\nparagraphs (1)(a) to (c); and\n(b) the person is not liable for a penalty under a provision of any\nlaw because the person does any of those matters.\n(3) This section applies whether or not the person is required to do a\nthing mentioned in subsection (1) in accordance with this Division.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a person does any of the following in good\nfaith for the purposes of an IC review:\n(a) gives information;\n(b) produces a document;\n(c) answers a question.\n(2) If this section applies, then:\n(a) civil proceedings do not lie against a person because the\nperson does any of the matters mentioned in\nparagraphs (1)(a) to (c); and\n(b) the person is not liable for a penalty under a provision of any\nlaw because the person does any of those matters.\n(3) This section applies whether or not the person is required to do a\nthing mentioned in subsection (1) in accordance with this Division.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55z-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55z-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55z-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da2ffc0fbf0dde1ccd0fea398491b29d0f37bf536ed19cb9483810d9f65fd7e5"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55z",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55Z Information gathering powers—protection from liability",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 157,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a person does any of the following in good\nfaith for the purposes of an IC review:\n(a) gives information;\n(b) produces a document;\n(c) answers a question.\n(2) If this section applies, then:\n(a) civil proceedings do not lie against a person because the\nperson does any of the matters mentioned in\nparagraphs (1)(a) to (c); and\n(b) the person is not liable for a penalty under a provision of any\nlaw because the person does any of those matters.\n(3) This section applies whether or not the person is required to do a\nthing mentioned in subsection (1) in accordance with this Division."
    },
