    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55ZD(8) Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.160",
      "values:originalText": "(8) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a\nperiod within which to consider the documents mentioned in\nsubsections (2) to (4) that is reasonable having regard to:\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a\nperiod within which to consider the documents mentioned in\nsubsections (2) to (4) that is reasonable having regard to:\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "742021bd340727a962153d279c8abb6b54023ec3d259310d2b1f7f29af52c58a",
      "skos:note": "The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a reasonable time to consider documents."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55ZD(8) Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 160,
      "values:originalText": "(8) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a\nperiod within which to consider the documents mentioned in\nsubsections (2) to (4) that is reasonable having regard to:\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8-norm",
