          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-57a-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-57a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "74b7d0ef4a3f63a1cbab048fc86cbe99b7d891a4e2c0f3c27d65b6405f83714e",
      "skos:note": "Part 5 of the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024 does not apply in relation to certain decisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-57a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57A(3) Tribunal reviewable decisions—which decisions are",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 166,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Part 5 (guidance and appeals panel) of the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024 does not apply in relation to:\n\n\nReview by the Tribunal  Part VIIA\nTribunal reviewable decisions  Division 2\nSection 57A\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(a) an application under subsection (1) for review of a decision;\nor\n(b) the decision of the Tribunal on the review."
    },
