      "cof:title": "58(6) Powers of Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The powers of the Tribunal under this section extend to matters\nrelating to charges payable under this Act in relation to a request."
    },
