    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-58a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58A Powers of Tribunal—requiring further searches",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-58a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a review on an application to the Tribunal\nunder section 57A if:\n(a) access to the document is refused under section 24A\n(document cannot be found etc.); or\n(b) access is purportedly given to the document (amongst others\nto which the request relates), but is not actually given.\n(2) For the purposes of the review, the Tribunal may require the\nagency or Minister concerned to conduct further searches for the\ndocument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a review on an application to the Tribunal\nunder section 57A if:\n(a) access to the document is refused under section 24A\n(document cannot be found etc.); or\n(b) access is purportedly given to the document (amongst others\nto which the request relates), but is not actually given.\n(2) For the purposes of the review, the Tribunal may require the\nagency or Minister concerned to conduct further searches for the\ndocument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-58a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-58a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6249c3a1aeb87e8ddf322df92063eb12c92a3aa38a4a720f2afd021768ea1d4a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-58a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58A Powers of Tribunal—requiring further searches",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a review on an application to the Tribunal\nunder section 57A if:\n(a) access to the document is refused under section 24A\n(document cannot be found etc.); or\n(b) access is purportedly given to the document (amongst others\nto which the request relates), but is not actually given.\n(2) For the purposes of the review, the Tribunal may require the\nagency or Minister concerned to conduct further searches for the\ndocument."
    },
