      "cml:integrityHash": "654b640609dcb9bba3f024a42984b898c2dc387f977418bde33865479ffdfdb8",
      "skos:note": "Document must be produced to the Tribunal if satisfied",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-58e-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58E(4) Production to the Tribunal of certain exempt documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Tribunal is satisfied as mentioned in subsection (3),\nsection 27 of the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024 does\nnot apply in relation to the document.\n\n\nReview by the Tribunal  Part VIIA\nProcedure in Tribunal  Division 4\nSection 60\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026"
    },
    {
