        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5efc4c8c2d5e8c5e66451b975e168aa590004c373f69c4f45418ba4a2b12a493",
      "skos:note": "List of parties to a proceeding before the Tribunal for a review of a decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-60-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60(3) Procedure in Tribunal—parties",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 171,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The parties to a proceeding before the Tribunal for a review of a\ndecision are as follows:\n(a) the person who applied to the Tribunal for a review of the\ndecision under section 57A;\n(b) the person who made the request or application in respect of\nwhich the decision was made;\n(c) the principal officer of the agency, or the Minister, to whom\nthe request or application was made;\n(d) any other person who is made a party to the proceeding by\nthe Tribunal under paragraph 22(1)(c) of the Administrative\nReview Tribunal Act 2024."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-60-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
