    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-64-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "64(2) Production of exempt documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-64-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.180",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Tribunal may require the production, for inspection by\nmembers of the Tribunal only, of an exempt document for the\npurpose of determining whether it is practicable for an agency or a\nMinister to grant access to a copy of the document with such\ndeletions as to make the copy not an exempt document and, where\nan exempt document is produced by reason of such a requirement,\nthe Tribunal shall, after inspection of the document by the\nmembers of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of the\nproceeding, return the document to the person by whom it was\nproduced without permitting a person to have access to the\ndocument, or disclosing the contents of the document to a person,\nunless the person is:\n(a) a member of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of\nthe proceeding; or",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Tribunal may require the production, for inspection by\nmembers of the Tribunal only, of an exempt document for the\npurpose of determining whether it is practicable for an agency or a\nMinister to grant access to a copy of the document with such\ndeletions as to make the copy not an exempt document and, where\nan exempt document is produced by reason of such a requirement,\nthe Tribunal shall, after inspection of the document by the\nmembers of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of the\nproceeding, return the document to the person by whom it was\nproduced without permitting a person to have access to the\ndocument, or disclosing the contents of the document to a person,\nunless the person is:\n(a) a member of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of\nthe proceeding; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-64"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-64-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-64-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d3b9041511cd75cdc348d98e5d98118ee3781b8186e8cca4f4d797cfc425947d",
      "skos:note": "Tribunal may not disclose exempt document contents to unauthorized persons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-64-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "64(2) Production of exempt documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 180,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Tribunal may require the production, for inspection by\nmembers of the Tribunal only, of an exempt document for the\npurpose of determining whether it is practicable for an agency or a\nMinister to grant access to a copy of the document with such\ndeletions as to make the copy not an exempt document and, where\nan exempt document is produced by reason of such a requirement,\nthe Tribunal shall, after inspection of the document by the\nmembers of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of the\nproceeding, return the document to the person by whom it was\nproduced without permitting a person to have access to the\ndocument, or disclosing the contents of the document to a person,\nunless the person is:\n(a) a member of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of\nthe proceeding; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-64-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-64-ss-2"
