    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-80",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "80 Information Commissioner investigations—dealings with",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-80"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.197",
      "values:originalText": "documents\nWhat the Information Commissioner may do with documents\n(1) The Information Commissioner may do one or more of the\nfollowing with respect to any documents produced in accordance\nwith a notice under subsection 79(3):\n(a) take possession of the documents;\n(b) make copies of the documents;\n(c) take extracts from the documents;\n(d) hold the documents for a period that is necessary for the\npurposes of the investigation.",
      "skos:definition": "documents\nWhat the Information Commissioner may do with documents\n(1) The Information Commissioner may do one or more of the\nfollowing with respect to any documents produced in accordance\nwith a notice under subsection 79(3):\n(a) take possession of the documents;\n(b) make copies of the documents;\n(c) take extracts from the documents;\n(d) hold the documents for a period that is necessary for the\npurposes of the investigation.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-80-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-80-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2a06cc307a916abce020de26ffbea94d69659db3ff73ba41b17f73827a9f732a",
      "skos:note": "Information Commissioner may take possession, make copies, extracts, or hold documents for investigation purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-80",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80 Information Commissioner investigations—dealings with",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 197,
      "values:originalText": "documents\nWhat the Information Commissioner may do with documents\n(1) The Information Commissioner may do one or more of the\nfollowing with respect to any documents produced in accordance\nwith a notice under subsection 79(3):\n(a) take possession of the documents;\n(b) make copies of the documents;\n(c) take extracts from the documents;\n(d) hold the documents for a period that is necessary for the\npurposes of the investigation."
    },
