          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-82-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-82-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-82-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-82-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-82-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c5f5097dba53c91462ddcf339f2576cfcfdb71cacec284054923f1efa7bc0d66",
      "skos:note": "Failure to comply with a notice requirement is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-82-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "82(3) Information Commissioner investigations—obliging persons to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 198,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n\n\nInvestigations and complaints  Part VIIB\nInformation Commissioner investigations  Division 2\nSection 83\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement specified in a notice\nunder subsection (1); and\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n(c) the person’s conduct breaches the requirement.\nPenalty for a contravention of this subsection:\n6 months\nimprisonment.\nNote:\nChapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of\ncriminal responsibility."
    },
    {
