    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-86-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "86(5) Information Commissioner investigations—notice on completion",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-86-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.200",
      "values:originalText": "(5) However, if the copy of the notice would contain matters of the\nkind mentioned in subsection 89C(2), the Information\nCommissioner must prepare a copy of the report to give to the\ncomplainant that excludes those matters.\nNote:\nSection 89D sets out further limitations on recommendations to amend\nrecords.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) However, if the copy of the notice would contain matters of the\nkind mentioned in subsection 89C(2), the Information\nCommissioner must prepare a copy of the report to give to the\ncomplainant that excludes those matters.\nNote:\nSection 89D sets out further limitations on recommendations to amend\nrecords.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-86"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-86-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-86-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "90a74856bbc923947be7193d4442e04a55bea9f64abecf825a9e8a940d4b72ea",
      "skos:note": "Information Commissioner must prepare a copy of the report to give to the complainant that excludes certain matters."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-86-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86(5) Information Commissioner investigations—notice on completion",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 200,
      "values:originalText": "(5) However, if the copy of the notice would contain matters of the\nkind mentioned in subsection 89C(2), the Information\nCommissioner must prepare a copy of the report to give to the\ncomplainant that excludes those matters.\nNote:\nSection 89D sets out further limitations on recommendations to amend\nrecords."
    },
