    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-87",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "87 Information Commissioner investigations—what are the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-87"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.201",
      "values:originalText": "investigation results?\nThe investigation results, in relation to the investigation, are the\nfollowing:\n(a) the matters that the Information Commissioner has\ninvestigated;\n(b) any opinions that the Information Commissioner has formed\nin relation to those matters;\n(c) any conclusions that the Information Commissioner has\nreached in relation to those matters;\n(d) any suggestions to the respondent agency the implementation\nof which the Information Commissioner believes might\nimprove the processes of the agency;\n(e) any other information of which the Information\nCommissioner believes the respondent agency ought to be\naware.",
      "skos:definition": "investigation results?\nThe investigation results, in relation to the investigation, are the\nfollowing:\n(a) the matters that the Information Commissioner has\ninvestigated;\n(b) any opinions that the Information Commissioner has formed\nin relation to those matters;\n(c) any conclusions that the Information Commissioner has\nreached in relation to those matters;\n(d) any suggestions to the respondent agency the implementation\nof which the Information Commissioner believes might\nimprove the processes of the agency;\n(e) any other information of which the Information\nCommissioner believes the respondent agency ought to be\naware.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-87-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-87-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9d077ea3f61b323e01083f83e65a29ff5200a078453f11f37a2e1af2c95300b7",
      "skos:note": "Investigation results must be provided by the respondent agency.",
      "dc:description": "True"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-87",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "87 Information Commissioner investigations—what are the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 201,
      "values:originalText": "investigation results?\nThe investigation results, in relation to the investigation, are the\nfollowing:\n(a) the matters that the Information Commissioner has\ninvestigated;\n(b) any opinions that the Information Commissioner has formed\nin relation to those matters;\n(c) any conclusions that the Information Commissioner has\nreached in relation to those matters;\n(d) any suggestions to the respondent agency the implementation\nof which the Information Commissioner believes might\nimprove the processes of the agency;\n(e) any other information of which the Information\nCommissioner believes the respondent agency ought to be\naware."
    },
