      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "investigation recommendations?\nThe investigation recommendations, in relation to the\ninvestigation, are the formal recommendations to the respondent\nagency that the Information Commissioner believes that the\nrespondent agency ought to implement.",
      "skos:definition": "investigation recommendations?\nThe investigation recommendations, in relation to the\ninvestigation, are the formal recommendations to the respondent\nagency that the Information Commissioner believes that the\nrespondent agency ought to implement.",
      "cml:asserts": [
