    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits agency from failing to take adequate action.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the Information Commissioner is not satisfied that the agency has taken action that is adequate and appropriate in the circumstances to implement the investigation recommendations for the investigation.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency must take adequate action."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits agency from failing to implement investigation recommendations.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the Information Commissioner gives an agency a notice under section 86;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency must implement investigation recommendations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89(2) Information Commissioner investigations—failure to implement",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-89-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Information Commissioner may, by notice in writing (an\nimplementation notice), require the respondent agency to:\n(a) give to the Information Commissioner particulars of any\naction that the agency proposes to take to implement the\ninvestigation recommendations for the investigation; and\n(b) give the particulars within the time specified in the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Information Commissioner may, by notice in writing (an\nimplementation notice), require the respondent agency to:\n(a) give to the Information Commissioner particulars of any\naction that the agency proposes to take to implement the\ninvestigation recommendations for the investigation; and\n(b) give the particulars within the time specified in the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7c09422ec00c7299792c5a42272beb5b03171461b871a87053fab1e837875b08",
      "skos:note": "Respondent agency must provide particulars of proposed action to implement investigation recommendations.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-89-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89(2) Information Commissioner investigations—failure to implement",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Information Commissioner may, by notice in writing (an\nimplementation notice), require the respondent agency to:\n(a) give to the Information Commissioner particulars of any\naction that the agency proposes to take to implement the\ninvestigation recommendations for the investigation; and\n(b) give the particulars within the time specified in the notice."
    },
