      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The respondent agency must comply with the implementation\nnotice.\n\n\nInvestigations and complaints  Part VIIB\nInformation Commissioner investigations  Division 2\nSection 89A\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The respondent agency must comply with the implementation\nnotice.\n\n\nInvestigations and complaints  Part VIIB\nInformation Commissioner investigations  Division 2\nSection 89A\nFreedom of Information Act 1982\nCompilation date: 01/01/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
