      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89H(2) Complaints to Ombudsman—certain rights not affected by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 207,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The certificate does not affect the Ombudsman’s right to:\n(a) seek from any person the reasons for a decision made under\nthis Act not to give access to an exempt document; or\n(b) require any person to give any information or to answer any\nquestions concerning the decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89h-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Right",
      "cml:modality": {
