    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89k",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89K Vexatious applicants—declaration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-89k"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.209",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Information Commissioner may, by written instrument (a\nvexatious applicant declaration), declare a person to be a\nvexatious applicant.\nNote 1:\nSection 89L sets out the grounds on which a declaration may be made.\nNote 2:\nFor variation and revocation of the instrument, see subsection 33(3) of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n(2) The Information Commissioner may make a declaration:\n(a) on the application of an agency or Minister; or\n(b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative.\n(3) If an agency or Minister has applied for a declaration, the agency\nor Minister has the onus of establishing that the Information\nCommissioner should make the declaration.\n(4) The Information Commissioner must, as soon as practicable, give\nwritten notice to the person in relation to whom the vexatious\napplicant declaration is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Information Commissioner may, by written instrument (a\nvexatious applicant declaration), declare a person to be a\nvexatious applicant.\nNote 1:\nSection 89L sets out the grounds on which a declaration may be made.\nNote 2:\nFor variation and revocation of the instrument, see subsection 33(3) of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n(2) The Information Commissioner may make a declaration:\n(a) on the application of an agency or Minister; or\n(b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative.\n(3) If an agency or Minister has applied for a declaration, the agency\nor Minister has the onus of establishing that the Information\nCommissioner should make the declaration.\n(4) The Information Commissioner must, as soon as practicable, give\nwritten notice to the person in relation to whom the vexatious\napplicant declaration is made.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89k-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89k-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89k-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89k-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "93e02fb45dc23a0c853420061f397326e5b96e2e42873355d0a4823e273061c2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-89k",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89K Vexatious applicants—declaration",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 209,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Information Commissioner may, by written instrument (a\nvexatious applicant declaration), declare a person to be a\nvexatious applicant.\nNote 1:\nSection 89L sets out the grounds on which a declaration may be made.\nNote 2:\nFor variation and revocation of the instrument, see subsection 33(3) of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n(2) The Information Commissioner may make a declaration:\n(a) on the application of an agency or Minister; or\n(b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative.\n(3) If an agency or Minister has applied for a declaration, the agency\nor Minister has the onus of establishing that the Information\nCommissioner should make the declaration.\n(4) The Information Commissioner must, as soon as practicable, give\nwritten notice to the person in relation to whom the vexatious\napplicant declaration is made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89k-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89K(1) Vexatious applicants—declaration",
