        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If an agency or Minister applies for a declaration, they have the onus of establishing that the Information Commissioner should make the declaration.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The agency or Minister must establish that the Information Commissioner should make the declaration if they apply for it."
    },
    {
