      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.209",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Information Commissioner must, as soon as practicable, give\nwritten notice to the person in relation to whom the vexatious\napplicant declaration is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Information Commissioner must, as soon as practicable, give\nwritten notice to the person in relation to whom the vexatious\napplicant declaration is made.",
