    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-93a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93A Guidelines",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-93a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.216",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Information Commissioner may, by instrument in writing,\nissue guidelines for the purposes of this Act.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation of the instrument, see subsection 33(3) of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n(2) For the purposes of the performance of a function, or the exercise\nof a power, under this Act, regard must be had to any guidelines\nissued by the Information Commissioner under this section\nincluding, but not limited to, guidelines issued for the purposes of\nthe following provisions:\n(a) paragraph 9A(b) (information publication scheme);\n(b) subsection 11B(5) (public interest factors);\n(c) subsection 15(5A) (decisions on requests).\n(3) Guidelines are not legislative instruments.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Information Commissioner may, by instrument in writing,\nissue guidelines for the purposes of this Act.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation of the instrument, see subsection 33(3) of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n(2) For the purposes of the performance of a function, or the exercise\nof a power, under this Act, regard must be had to any guidelines\nissued by the Information Commissioner under this section\nincluding, but not limited to, guidelines issued for the purposes of\nthe following provisions:\n(a) paragraph 9A(b) (information publication scheme);\n(b) subsection 11B(5) (public interest factors);\n(c) subsection 15(5A) (decisions on requests).\n(3) Guidelines are not legislative instruments.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-93a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-93a-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-93a-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "76900eef3bc4c3c8249f8aeb8cc83c621ba5faf7c1412f0a396b5bed40b5fd32"
    },
    {
