      "cml:integrityHash": "66708247f67edddde2138e1f9ae573f51afa8560a0789e45905522dad494ebf5",
      "skos:note": "Regard must be had to guidelines issued by the Information Commissioner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-act-1982#sch-4-sec-93a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93A(2) Guidelines",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 216,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of the performance of a function, or the exercise\nof a power, under this Act, regard must be had to any guidelines\nissued by the Information Commissioner under this section\nincluding, but not limited to, guidelines issued for the purposes of\nthe following provisions:\n(a) paragraph 9A(b) (information publication scheme);\n(b) subsection 11B(5) (public interest factors);\n(c) subsection 15(5A) (decisions on requests)."
    },
